="420" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1524</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1524</guid><pubDate>Fri, 02 Jan 2026 11:04:07 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 ANI-RSS: 基于 RSS 自动追番、订阅、下载、刮削</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;ANI-RSS: 基于 RSS 自动追番、订阅、下载、刮削&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该项目 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1523?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt;，GitHub 上 2K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;，支持 Docker/Win/NAS 部署。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;网站: &lt;a href="https://docs.wushuo.top/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://docs.wushuo.top/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repo: &lt;a href="https://github.com/wushuo894/ani-rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/wushuo894/ani-rss&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道: &lt;a href="https://t.me/ani_rss_666" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://t.me/ani_rss_666&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/iaFQ4HMKbPsxVtTyzv0z8Njb1I6aG6GOUU_FX_2WqkGHNFB-rYyaSBHYpqTPcXykP--2uCOoiYe7BdditPML61-viBHzTxyrgCk2sbGhcc7taMaEufPK6OGHUeggpCxLevk6VUnAFuBeen8F-iNK1nKaHPfiTpPwP3EIbmQbVB_26jM5bYKaQwbC8pleOep3fUaidHv-5mWR9aPltH2BY4OmDJYM7mHl6nSsSwJ8fEPhpNLKx0Q9BPSONe45p0ueGRjewUoBAhPC7UEeqTwO4l59gRpgkEsBLsEPp99l1pERLaPTEXFhC85YAUFABnOOOR6NkwjXffDlFVJQK65LFA.jpg" width="800" height="691" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1523</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1523</guid><pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 08:05:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Tiny Tiny RSS 作者将停止维护该项目</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tiny Tiny RSS 作者将停止维护该项目&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;项目作者在 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1522?q=%23TTRSS"&gt;#TTRSS&lt;/a&gt; 官方论坛发布：&lt;a href="https://community.tt-rss.org/t/the-end-of-tt-rss-org/7164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;The end of tt-rss.org&lt;/a&gt;，宣布11月1日终止该项目。目前已有项目贡献者 fork 源码、插件、文档等并转载至 GitHub ，且愿意接棒项目开发